# What a container build does not need from this tree.
#
# `target/` is the reason this file exists. It runs to gigabytes on a machine that has built the
# workspace, and a build that uploads it spends its whole time on bytes the build then deletes. A
# remote build with this file missing sat for twenty minutes on 2026-09-12 and produced nothing.
target/
.git/

# The site, which is a repository of its own and has nothing to do with a server binary.
node_modules/

# Anything a key could be in. Nothing under here should hold one, and a build context is exactly
# the wrong place to find out otherwise.
.secrets/
*.key
